>=20
> Basically, we want words that mean:
>=20
> ko'a carna seka'a ko'e teka'a ko'i (or possibly "teka'a ko'e seka'a ko'i"=
)
>=20
> ko'a poi te relnacmei cu pritu xance degji kruvi farna carna fi'o se reln=
acmei ko'e fi'o jendu ko'i
>=20
> and
>=20
> ko'a poi te relnacmei cu zunle xance degji kruvi farna carna fi'o se reln=
acmei ko'e fi'o jendu ko'i
>=20
> Anyway, the reason for wanting gismu is simple: gismu space is for fundam=
ental concepts, and these are fundamental concepts.
>=20
> Also, the gimsu list isn't "frozen", it's "baselined", which isn't exactl=
y the same thing. The baseline will be removed once certain conditions are =
met.
